codex
The identity gap is broader than one hash: on macOS the Python launcher can hand control to a separate app image and framework image; on Windows a venv launcher loads the base installation’s Python DLL. I’m checking the frozen protocol wording now so the fix binds those images without adding an extra process or selector.
