+| `.venv/bin/python -m mypy --version` | 0 | `mypy 2.3.0 (compiled: yes)` |
+
+All authoritative Python validation will use the task-worktree interpreter
+explicitly as `.venv/bin/python`.
+
+## Native-host tooling
+
+| Tool command | Exit | Output |
